{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/41321-police-man-sold-stolen-brains-online","id":41321,"title":"Police: Man sold stolen brains online","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-02T14:21:43-08:00","id":41321,"title":"Police: Man sold stolen brains online","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.theindychannel.com/news/local-news/police-man-sold-stolen-brains-online\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.theindychannel.com/news/local-news/police-man-sold-stolen-brains-online\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.theindychannel.com/news/local-news/police-man-sold-stolen-brains-online\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.theindychannel.com/news/local-news/police-man-sold-stolen-brains-online </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> INDIANAPOLIS - An Indianapolis man was arrested on theft charges after admitting he stole jars of brain tissue and sold them online, police said.<br /> David Charles, 21, of Indianapolis, told Metro police he broke into the Indiana Medical History Museum six times in 2013 and stole jars of human tissue, including human brains.<br /> Officials were tipped off by a California man who bought six jars of brain matter online and realized they had been taken from the museum, according to the probable cause affidavit.<br /> The San Diego, Calif., buyer said he paid $600, plus $70 for shipping, to purchase the six jars of tissue.<br /> Charles was arrested Dec. 16 after agreeing to sell human tissue to an undercover officer.<br /> Police said a detective met Charles in the parking lot of an Indianapolis Dairy Queen, and arranged to buy a duffle bag containing 20 jars of human tissue.<br /> A pre-trial conference for Charles has been scheduled for Jan. 13.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T14:37:56-08:00","id":41332,"title":"","content":"I wonder whose mental state should I be more worried about... The guy who sold brains on-line or the one who bought all six of them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1700-blue-fox","name":"Blue Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T14:47:26-08:00","id":41341,"title":"","content":"What else was he going to do after he stole them? After all, a mind is a terrible thing to waste.<br /> <br /> Ah, well, it's all the fault of whoever told him not to work hard, but to work smart.<br /> <br /> You know the old saw, &quot;More money than brains?&quot; Well, who's laughing now, world?<br /> <br /> (Giant shephard's crook starts pulling Prometheus off-stage) Wait, wait, I got a million of these! Better to have lobes and lost, then to never have lobes at AAAHHHH!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member